                <mxCell id="233" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=#fff9c4;strokeColor=#f57f17;fontSize=12;" value="Sync wave order ensures:&#xa;  1. Meilisearch (wave -1) is up before LibreChat starts using search&#xa;  2. LibreChat + MongoDB (wave 0) sync together — same lifecycle, same Application (ADR-0014)&#xa;  3. The Agent Seed Job runs AFTER the librechat-app sync is complete (PostSync hook)&#xa;Sync policy: prune + selfHeal, CreateNamespace, ServerSideApply. Charts float from OCI: a merge to main is a deploy." vertex="1">
