                <mxCell id="309" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f5e9;strokeColor=#2e7d32;fontStyle=0;fontSize=13;" value="Phase 2: LibreChat REST API (browser UA)&#xa;GET /api/agents → index by NAME&#xa;Leaves first, then orchestrators (subagent ids)&#xa;exists → PATCH · new → POST&#xa;PUT /api/permissions/agent/&lt;_id&gt; → PUBLIC view&#xa;PRUNE platform agents no longer in the fleet&#xa;(rename = new id + old one deleted)" vertex="1">
