                <mxCell id="315" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=#fff9c4;strokeColor=#f57f17;fontSize=12;" value="Why PostSync and not Init Container?&#xa;  An Init Container runs before the main pod is ready.&#xa;  The seed script calls LibreChat&#39;s own API — LibreChat must be healthy first.&#xa;  PostSync guarantees the Application is Healthy before the Job fires.&#xa;&#xa;Idempotent: running the seed twice produces the same result.&#xa;BeforeHookCreation: old Job deleted before new one created — no orphaned Jobs." vertex="1">
