                <mxCell id="382" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=#fff9c4;strokeColor=#f57f17;fontSize=12;" value="One key authenticates LibreChat (CONVERSE_OPENAI_API_KEY),&#xa;but X-LibreChat-User turns every call into a PER-USER request:&#xa;per-user RPM, per-user dashboards, and the SAME account key&#xa;as that person&#39;s opencode usage.&#xa;LibreChat&#39;s own balance is disabled — the gateway counts." vertex="1">
