                <mxCell id="513" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff3e0;strokeColor=#ef6c00;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" value="Why a separate namespace? NsJail needs SYS_ADMIN-class capabilities → Pod Security &#39;privileged&#39;&#xa;(charts/apps global.namespacePodSecurity). Isolating it keeps that elevation away from LibreChat, Mongo and Meilisearch.&#xa;Why a flat app, not a librechart child? The ApplicationSet gives every child the SAME namespace (converse).&#xa;Images: ghcr.io/adorsys-gis/code-interpreter-* @ sha-d3b0f05 (upstream clickhouse/code-interpreter publishes none).&#xa;CiliumNetworkPolicy (ai-helm-values deps overlay): only file-server may reach *.your-objectstorage.com:443.&#xa;Sync options: CreateNamespace + ServerSideApply only (Replace=true breaks on immutable PVC/Job fields)." vertex="1">
